OL,3,GNEWSAThe ballroom dancer, 84, who has
OL,4,A'never looked back'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 84-year-old woman who makes a weekly
OL,7,F160 mile (257 km) round trip to dance
OL,8,Fat the famous Blackpool Tower Ballroom
OL,9,Fsaid her heart "lights up" every time
OL,10,Fshe steps inside.
OL,12,FRita Mackenzie started making the trip
OL,13,Ffrom Huddersfield in Yorkshire to the
OL,14,Fseaside resort in Lancashire almost 30
OL,15,Fyears ago following her divorce.
OL,17,F"It was my second home and now it's
OL,18,Fbecome my first home more or less," she
OL,19,Fsaid.
