OL,3,GNEWSAThe ballroom dancer, 84, who has
OL,4,A'never looked back'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt first, Rita said she was nervous to
OL,7,Fdrive on the motorway by herself but
OL,8,Fcounts it as one of the best decisions
OL,9,Fshe has made.
